There's a reading and writing section and a math&nbsp;
section. With maths there's mostly multiple choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:27.440
and for some questions you can't&nbsp;
use a calculator and some you can.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.440
So here's the math questions and&nbsp;
they do start off pretty easy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:37.920
we have finding the value of an unknown in a&nbsp;
simple equation. So we've got algebra, some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:43.920
algebra again here with more of a word problem&nbsp;
and working out a linear relationship from this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:51.040
