00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:46.720
wrote C because I got bamboozled over whether or&nbsp;
not they were talking about the principal root.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:52.720
I can claim that the questions were kind of easy&nbsp;
for me but i'm really not the target audience for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:58.240
this i'm older than what you would be trying&nbsp;
to sit this which I think would be around 17.

